<view class="friend-page ui-page"><view class="friend-stage"><text>把喜欢分享，和朋友一起享</text><view>我的好友</view><image src="/sage_dksy/resource/red/hero.png" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="friend-total"><text>{{direct===null?'—':direct}}</text><text>位已归属好友</text></view></view><view class="friend-count-row"><view><text>{{direct===null?'—':direct}}</text><text>累计好友</text></view><view><text>{{today===null?'—':today}}</text><text>今日新增</text></view></view><view class="friend-heading"><text>好友记录</text><text>以实际归属为准</text></view><yx-state wx:if="{{loading&&!loaded}}" type="loading"/><yx-state wx:elif="{{message&&!loaded}}" type="error" title="好友暂未加载" description="{{message}}" action="重新加载" bindaction="retry"/><view wx:else class="friend-list"><yx-state wx:if="{{!items.length}}" type="empty" title="好朋友，还在来的路上" description="分享专属海报，自主邀请朋友体验元享。" action="制作邀请海报" bindaction="goPoster"/><view class="friend-person" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="member_mask"><view class="friend-avatar"><yx-icon name="user" tone="brand" size="42"/></view><view><text>{{item.nickname||'元享好友'}}</text><text>{{item.member_mask}} · {{item.registered}}</text></view><text>已归属</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{message&&loaded}}" bindtap="retry" class="ui-error">{{message}}　重试</view><button wx:if="{{hasMore}}" bindtap="loadMore" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}" class="ui-text-button">加载更多好友</button><view class="friend-note"><yx-icon name="shield" tone="muted" size="34"/><text>好友关系由真实访问与服务端记录确认。<text>邀请不代表立即获得金币或现金奖励。</text></text></view><view class="friend-footer"><button class="ui-primary" bindtap="goPoster">继续邀请好友</button></view></view>
